Subject: [PATCH 4/8] Document the FlashInfer MXFP4 MoE variants in the kernel
 feature table

The flashinfer experts row listed only nvfp4 and fp8, but the backend
has covered MXFP4 weights since the SM90 W4A16 and SM100 MXFP8 paths.
Add the type along with a note for the SM90 MXFP4 x FP8 variant, whose
activations are quantized inside the kernel rather than by vLLM.

